OL,3,GNEWSAWork on new arts and heritage
OL,4,Acentre set to begin
OL,5,
OL,6,FConstruction work to create a new arts
OL,7,Fand heritage centre over a car park in
OL,8,Fa UNESCO World Heritage Site is set to
OL,9,Fbegin.
OL,11,FBradford Council said the
OL,12,Fmulti-million-pound facility, called
OL,13,FThe James Roberts Centre, will improve
OL,14,Fpublic access to a collection of
OL,15,Fartefacts and stories chronicling
OL,16,FSaltaire's history.
OL,18,FThe council last year approved the
OL,19,Ftransfer of the Caroline Street car
OL,20,Fpark in Saltaire to Shipley College,
OL,21,Fdespite receiving more than 140 objects
OL,22,Fduring a consultation period.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
