OL,3,GNEWSAWork on new arts and heritage
OL,4,Acentre set to begin
OL,5,
OL,6,FBradford councillor Andrew Judson said
OL,7,Fthe new centre is "an investment in
OL,8,Fpeople and in the future prosperity of
OL,9,Fthe district".
